# Axiom Retrieval Triggers

Use this rule when the task asks for strategy, architecture, prioritization, AI workflow design, retrospective judgment, or a question about how Bokan thinks.

First read `09_cursor/axioms/INDEX.md`, then open only the relevant axiom files.

Trigger map:
- AI management, delegation, agent reliability -> A03, A04, A17, A19
- prompt design, context, memory, docs -> A05, A08, A14, T03
- hidden assumptions, better framing, true goal -> A16
- reader, persona, doc usefulness -> A20
- verification, trust, current facts -> V02, V04, T11
- priority, bottleneck, leverage -> M03, X03

Axioms inform judgment. They do not override local truth surfaces, source materials, or explicit user constraints.
